---
---

<section class="py-20 relative overflow-hidden" style="background-color: #061126;">

  <!-- Tech grid pattern overlay -->
  <div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-10 pointer-events-none" aria-hidden="true">
    <svg width="100%" height="100%" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
      <defs>
        <pattern id="tech-grid" x="0" y="0" width="48" height="48" patternUnits="userSpaceOnUse">
          <path d="M 48 0 L 0 0 0 48" fill="none" stroke="#08CBEF" stroke-width="0.75"/>
        </pattern>
      </defs>
      <rect width="100%" height="100%" fill="url(#tech-grid)"/>
    </svg>
  </div>

  <!-- Subtle glow blobs -->
  <div class="absolute top-0 left-1/4 w-96 h-96 rounded-full pointer-events-none" style="background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(8,203,239,0.08) 0%, transparent 70%);"></div>
  <div class="absolute bottom-0 right-1/4 w-96 h-96 rounded-full pointer-events-none" style="background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(36,99,235,0.10) 0%, transparent 70%);"></div>

  <div class="relative z-10 max-w-[1280px] mx-auto px-6 lg:px-8 text-center">

    <!-- Title -->
    <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-white mb-6 leading-tight">
      ¿Listo para transformar tu negocio?
    </h2>

    <!-- Description -->
    <p class="text-lg max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-10 leading-relaxed" style="color: rgba(255,255,255,0.7);">
      Hablemos de tu proyecto y descubre cómo la tecnología y el marketing digital pueden ayudarte a alcanzar tus objetivos.
    </p>

    <!-- Buttons -->
    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center items-center">

      <!-- Primary CTA -->
      <a
        href="#contacto"
        class="w-full sm:w-auto text-center font-semibold px-8 py-4 rounded-full transition-all duration-300 hover:opacity-90 hover:scale-105"
        style="background-color: #08CBEF; color: #061126;"
      >
        Hablemos de tu proyecto
      </a>

      <!-- Secondary CTA -->
      <a
        href="#servicios"
        class="w-full sm:w-auto text-center font-semibold px-8 py-4 rounded-full border-2 text-white transition-all duration-300 hover:scale-105"
        style="border-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.6);"
        onmouseover="this.style.backgroundColor='rgba(255,255,255,0.1)'"
        onmouseout="this.style.backgroundColor='transparent'"
      >
        Ver servicios
      </a>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<style>
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    * { transition: none !important; animation: none !important; }
  }
</style>
